### Logowanie Jakuba - serwer uruchomiony z JWT_EXPIRES_IN=10s
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jakub.sosnowski@example.com",
  "password": "jakub-password-123"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("shortToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### Po ponad 10 sekundach - token wygasł (401 Token expired)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{shortToken}}
